de9 -> 49eefc2c, check_steps.py 083dece7 -> cc7764e9 (blobs archived). RH60_STAMP stays GRID.stamp (7a3c6b28); the new records bind to PREREG_GAP through this entry (amendment pin >= 20). Grid G stays FAIL (K3g) as registered; both are reported."}
